        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>모아원의 중심은 $( \frac{\sigma_{x} + \sigma_{y}}{2} , 0 ) .$이다.</choice_text>
          <commentary>중심의 좌표로 옳다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>주응력 $\sigma_{1 , 2} = \frac{\sigma_{x} + \sigma_{y}}{2} \pm R$이다.</choice_text>
