        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[X] (정답)">
          <choice_text>주평면의 주각 $\theta_{p} = \frac{1}{2} \tan^{- 1} \left( \sqrt{{\frac{2 \tau_{xy}}{\sigma_{x} - \sigma_{y}}}} \right )$이다.</choice_text>
          <commentary>제곱근이 들어가 옳지 않아 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
